odeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"En\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are equivalent and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en_US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepted as ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en-US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    The locale is fixed for the lifetime of the returned instance. Passing a different `locale` for an","    already initialized `channelKey` has no effect - call `Zendesk.invalidate()` first, then `initialize`","    with the new locale.","","    Backend content — bot replies, settings and campaigns — follows this locale, as does the","    UIKit messaging interface (labels, buttons, error messages, VoiceOver descriptions, dates and","    plural forms). Lookup falls back from an exact match (`\"en-AU\"`) to the closest available","    translation (`\"en-GB\"`) and finally to the SDK's built-in English. Your app's own string","    overrides in `Bundle.main` continue to take precedence for the chosen locale.","","    Some things deliberately keep following the device: layout *direction*, Help Center article","    *content*, the Zendesk Voice SDK interface, and regional formatting (calendar, number separators,","    file-size units)."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Zendesk"},{"type":"text","text":" instance will be returned."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"name":"Attention","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method must complete successfully before ","type":"text"},{"code":"Zendesk.instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be called.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"After a successful call has been made, calling it again with the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"channelKey"},{"text":" will succeed immediately","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without performing a network call."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This will throw an error of type "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"type":"text","text":" in case of failure."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Initializes ","type":"text"},{"code":"Zendesk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the given ","type":"text"},{"code":"channelKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A ","type":"text"},{"code":"MessagingFactory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be optionally passed here","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Messaging"},{"text":" capability. This method is an asynchronous call","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that retrieves settings from the network that calls the ","type":"text"},{"code":"completionHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the result.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/zendesksdk\/zendesk\/initialize(withchannelkey:messagingfactory:locale:)"]}],"references":{"doc://com.zendesk.Zendesk/documentation/ZendeskSDK/Zendesk":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.zendesk.Zendesk\/documentation\/ZendeskSDK\/Zendesk","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Zendesk"}],"title":"Zendesk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The entry point to execute SDK actions. To obtain an instance use "},{"code":"Zendesk.initialize(channelKey:completionHandler:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/zendesksdk\/zendesk","t